# Web3Forms access key — powers the contact form.
#
# Get one free (takes ~30 seconds, no account needed):
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com
#   2. Enter anjalidalsaniya2212@gmail.com
#   3. The access key is emailed to you
#
# Then copy this file to `.env.local` and paste the key below.
# `.env.local` is gitignored, so the key never gets committed.
#
# Until this is set, the contact form falls back to opening the visitor's
# mail client (the old mailto behaviour).

NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
